Z||000003||theogre||05-24-2001||10:45 AM||||Vacuum leaks.... loose wires.... base timing off....<P>check charging system, it can cause this... You can get this done free many places.<P>ticking could be timing gears, ignition, valve, valve rocker...||||reg||1
