Z||000007||NASAReeves||05-25-2001||07:38 AM||||Yep...give us the codes.  That happened to me about two years back, but it started mild & gradually got worse.  My Problem:  Alternator going bad.  You can take a broom stick (or anything solid) and make contact (be careful not to touch the belt-side) while listening/feeling the other end.  That will tell you if that's the problem.  Well...the broom won't jump up & speak to you, but vibrations will.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>To really give you any good information, though...we need the codes.<P>------------------<BR>Scott & Traci<BR>'88 GT<p>[This message has been edited by NASAReeves (edited 05-25-2001).]||||reg||4
